AB  - Macromolecular network rigidity of synthetic membranes is essential for sieving of hot gases. Hyper-cross-linked polyPOSS-imide membranes with tailored intercage spacing are presented. The length and flexibility of their imide bridges enables tuning of gas permeability and selectivity in a broad temperature range. The facile synthesis allows for large-scale production of membranes designed for specific process conditions. © 2014 American Chemical Society.
